  "extraction_notes": [
    "PDF hash verified as 07b7089a1fb615a41637cd047bb9fa4b646940d47a87f81bfed5054f147a7435.",
    "The PDF title is S8050M and the branding is Blue Rocket Electronics; the requested exact target is the D hFE classification variant S8050M-D from Foshan Blue Rocket Elec.",
    "Page 1 class D marking is HY3D with hFE range 160 to 300. The page 2 electrical-characteristics table is published for S8050M and gives hFE(1) minimum 85 and maximum 300 at IC = 100 mA, hFE(2) minimum 40 at IC = 500 mA, and hFE(3) minimum 45 at IC = 5.0 mA; these table bounds were preserved without converting them to typical values.",
    "The page 2 table gives fT typical 190 MHz and minimum 100 MHz at VCE = 10 V and IC = 50 mA. The schema has one fT slot, so the typical value is stored and the minimum is retained in this note.",
    "The page 2 table gives VCE(sat) typical 0.28 V and maximum 0.5 V, and VBE(sat) typical 0.98 V and maximum 1.2 V, at IC = 500 mA and IB = 50 mA. Both meanings are represented as separate saturation entries.",
    "Input capacitance Cibo is not published. Collector output capacitance Cob is the published 9 pF maximum at VCB = 10 V, IE = 0, and f = 1.0 MHz.",
    "Curve points were manually digitized only at visible grid-aligned locations from the usable plots on p. 3. No points were interpolated between selected locations; figure temperatures are not stated and were not assumed."
  ],
